  "notes": "{慰|なぐさ}める means to comfort or console someone who is sad or distressed.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{慰|なぐさ}む→慰む：27805_nagusamu⟧ (intransitive, to find comfort)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n⟦{慰|なぐさ}め→慰む：27805_nagusamu⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates the ongoing act of comforting someone.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{友達|ともだち}→友達：01478_tomodachi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{慰|なぐさ}める: to comfort a friend\n- ⟦{悲|かな}しんでいる→悲しむ：02042_kanashimu⟧⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{慰|なぐさ}める: to console someone who is grieving\n- ⟦{自分|じぶん}→自分：02887_jibun⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{慰|なぐさ}める: to console oneself\n- ⟦{言葉|ことば}→言葉：02880_kotoba⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{慰|なぐさ}める: to comfort with words\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{慰|なぐさ}め→慰め：21650_nagusame⟧: comfort, consolation (noun)\n- ⟦{慰安|いあん}→慰安：27804_ian⟧: comfort, solace\n- ⟦{慰謝料|いしゃりょう}→慰謝料：14802_isharyou⟧: consolation money, damages\n- ⟦{慰労|いろう}→慰労：25276_irou⟧: recognition of someone's hard work\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{励|はげ}ます→励ます：05304_hagemasu⟧: to encourage (focuses on cheering up)\n- {慰|なぐさ}める: to comfort (focuses on easing sorrow)",
